  "content": "\n\n<h1>TokorotenSlime</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/164b742803c1b94fb9134c66b54213da7a2840c7.png\" alt=\"tokorotenslime\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fkasaradanamo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">X(Twitter)</a></strong><br></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/kasaradanamo/TokorotenSlime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong><br></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>一款核心模組，新增數個物品與方塊，作為擴充套件的基礎。</p>\n<p>目前功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fkasaradanamo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">炸鯖魚（食物）</a></strong><ul>\n<li>這是一種極佳的食品，能長時間維持飽食度。</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/kasaradanamo/TokorotenSlime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">裹粉魚（食物）</a></strong><ul>\n<li>烤熟後會變成炸鯖魚。</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/kasaradanamo/TokorotenSlime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">展示台方塊</a></strong><ul>\n<li>可立體展示物品。</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/431c901c24df268f89d2ee5599161e18a9f23847.png\" alt=\"better_fish_craft\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a717286ade460ab6293cb1cbc6a03f48cf45bcc1.png\" alt=\"pedestal_craft\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>一款新增多種物品與方塊的模組，作為擴充套件的基礎運作。</p>\n<p>目前新增內容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fkasaradanamo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">炸鯖魚（食物）</a></strong><ul>\n<li>一種極佳的食物，能長時間維持飽食度。</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/kasaradanamo/TokorotenSlime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">裹粉魚（食物）</a></strong><ul>\n<li>烤熟後會變成炸鯖魚。</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/kasaradanamo/TokorotenSlime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">展示台方塊</a></strong><ul>\n<li>可立體展示並裝飾物品。</li></ul></li>\n</ul>",
